# Derived caches: regenerated automatically by make_figures.py. The binomial
# lattice grid behind fig_baw_accuracy takes ~70s to recompute, hence the cache,
# but it is derived data and the project does not track derived data.
figures/_cache_*.csv

# LaTeX build intermediates. paper.pdf itself IS tracked, so the compiled paper
# is reviewable without a TeX install.
*.aux
*.out
*.log
*.synctex.gz
